id=gxr-alvr
name=Galaxy XR ALVR relay
version=v1.1.2
versionCode=5
author=komp
description=Starts the Galaxy XR perception relay (gxr_alvr) as root at boot (and on late-load). Auto-connects to the PC by broadcasting the full UE parameter set (incl. TongueRoll) on UDP 41463 (no PC setup needed); pin a PC with the module's pc/port files. Wire format: one ALVR "UniExpr" record.
